      ExpressionUUID->"32f2bb74-d552-e04b-ad26-8be25a09cef1"],
     ". Needs to be {T1muscl, T1Fat, T2Fat} in ms, defaul is {1400,365,137} \
in ms."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"6683ed36-7efa-d04f-9ff8-3d0bc839a007"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "a1917aa1-d2d4-3349-b47b-84cd01c5d488"], 
    ButtonBox["EPGFitPoints",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/EPGFitPoints"], "50", Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData[
      ButtonBox["EPGFitPoints",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/EPGFitPoints"]], "InlineFormula",
      ExpressionUUID->"63d1fe5f-c62a-844b-bf0d-ca542f2779b0"],
     " is a option for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
     "CalibrateEPGT2Fit"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
